    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.poster.avif?t=1750149483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.webm?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.mp4?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ending.<br> But the truth lies in what's left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an asteroid speeds toward Earth, Seoul has fallen into ruin. In <i>Goodbye Seoul</i>, you play as Rion, a student navigating a collapsed city in search of answers\u2014trailing the remnants of a secret space evacuation project that may be humanity\u2019s final chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hauntingly beautiful post-apocalyptic Seoul in this story-rich puzzle-platformer. Solve environmental puzzles and piece together the mystery behind the covert operation. But beware\u2014this city isn\u2019t empty.<br>From unstable ruins to hostile survivors, every step forward is a risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>About the</strong>\u00a0<strong>Story</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Six months until an asteroid impact. Hope is the first to fall. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/4d6d39f05490c6c6a1bafe66d97685b4.poster.avif?t=1750149483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/4d6d39f05490c6c6a1bafe66d97685b4.webm?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/4d6d39f05490c6c6a1bafe66d97685b4.mp4?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the truth behind a secret evacuation project</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/30c79e1d31edb25751f7fadd3c110c45.poster.avif?t=1750149483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/30c79e1d31edb25751f7fadd3c110c45.webm?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/30c79e1d31edb25751f7fadd3c110c45.mp4?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Confront your self-doubts. Discover what\u2019s worth surviving for.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/e56a6fa29243c783f0ba11de72b3d05f.poster.avif?t=1750149483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/e56a6fa29243c783f0ba11de72b3d05f.webm?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/e56a6fa29243c783f0ba11de72b3d05f.mp4?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Gameplay</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team up with desperate survivors and unlikely allies scattered across Seoul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/8421aded3284f0aa55c8e7a504ae4d0b.poster.avif?t=1750149483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/8421aded3284f0aa55c8e7a504ae4d0b.webm?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/8421aded3284f0aa55c8e7a504ae4d0b.mp4?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the environment to avoid confrontation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/4f41e0a7c5b05589292984a1100e45a1.poster.avif?t=1750149483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/4f41e0a7c5b05589292984a1100e45a1.webm?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/4f41e0a7c5b05589292984a1100e45a1.mp4?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Observe. Think. Survive - every detail is part of the puzzle.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/fa16bfa77b84369f9f2a97ce35256bf1.poster.avif?t=1750149483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/fa16bfa77b84369f9f2a97ce35256bf1.webm?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/fa16bfa77b84369f9f2a97ce35256bf1.mp4?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.poster.avif?t=1750149483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.webm?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.mp4?t=1750149483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ending.<br> But the truth lies in what's left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an asteroid speeds toward Earth, Seoul has fallen into ruin. In <i>Goodbye Seoul</i>, you play as Rion, a student navigating a collapsed city in search of answers\u2014trailing the remnants of a secret space evacuation project that may be humanity\u2019s final chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hauntingly beautiful post-apocalyptic Seoul in this story-rich puzzle-platformer. Solve environmental puzzles and piece together the mystery behind the covert operation. But beware\u2014this city isn\u2019t empty.<br>From unstable ruins to hostile survivors, every step forward is a risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>About the</strong>\u00a0<strong>Story</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Six months until an asteroid impact. Hope is the first to fall. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play